    "When Apple Intelligence doesn't support the language you're writing in, suggest with %@ instead. Turn off to get no suggestion in those languages." : {
      "comment" : "Fork-owned display copy; the upstream common-table translation contains the previous product brand.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "استخدم %@ للاقتراحات عندما لا يدعم Apple Intelligence اللغة التي تكتب بها. أوقف هذا الخيار لعدم عرض اقتراح بتلك اللغات."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn Apple Intelligence die Sprache, in der du schreibst, nicht unterstützt, stattdessen %@ verwenden. Deaktivieren, um in diesen Sprachen keinen Vorschlag zu erhalten."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When Apple Intelligence doesn't support the language you're writing in, suggest with %@ instead. Turn off to get no suggestion in those languages."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuando Apple Intelligence no admita el idioma en el que escribes, usa %@ para generar sugerencias en su lugar. Desactívalo para no recibir sugerencias en esos idiomas."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si Apple Intelligence ne prend pas en charge la langue dans laquelle vous écrivez, Lingrove peut utiliser %@ à la place. Désactivez cette option pour ne recevoir aucune suggestion dans ces langues."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "जब Apple Intelligence उस भाषा का समर्थन न करे जिसमें आप लिख रहे हैं, तो इसके बजाय %@ से सुझाव दें। उन भाषाओं में सुझाव न पाने के लिए इसे बंद करें।"
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Saat Apple Intelligence tidak mendukung bahasa yang Anda gunakan untuk menulis, beri saran dengan %@. Matikan untuk tidak menerima saran dalam bahasa tersebut."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se Apple Intelligence non supporta la lingua in cui scrivi, usa %@ per i suggerimenti. Disattiva questa opzione per non ricevere suggerimenti in quelle lingue."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Intelligenceが入力中の言語に対応していない場合は、代わりに%@で候補を表示します。オフにすると、その言語では候補を表示しません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Intelligence가 작성 중인 언어를 지원하지 않으면 대신 %@으로 제안합니다. 끄면 해당 언어로 제안하지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Quando o Apple Intelligence não oferecer suporte ao idioma em que você escreve, sugerir com %@. Desative para não receber sugestões nesses idiomas."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Если Apple Intelligence не поддерживает язык, на котором вы пишете, используйте вместо неё %@. Выключите этот параметр, чтобы не получать подсказки на этих языках."
